    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I'm fine with this being a global variable, but I think this name doesn't sufficiently explain what/when it's used. A couple things on my mind:\r\n\r\n- I don't want anyone outside of of InstantSearch depending on this, so it should be prefixed with `_`\r\n- I'm not sure `re-render` is what we want to convey, maybe it's \"unstable widgets\", \"pending render\", \"render requested\", \"hasRenderedAllWidgets\" or something more like that?",
    "commit_id": "fefa3bc12c1abc42572bb8b6548793cdef4e553f",
    "created_at": "2023-06-19T09:20:17Z",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -203,6 +203,7 @@ class InstantSearch<\n    * The error gets cleared when the next valid search response is rendered.\n    */\n   public error: Error | undefined = undefined;\n+  public willRerender: boolean = false;",
